e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V8ZaDaYos_sQ7kNvwEALyy-&_nc_oc=Adpz0FtTIuOt5jat1ltpWAXr_YcMAzDskK8WveivJHEoHwSwbu7LQTaWYSaw9EIJ1fw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQtgwQLG8IUjUplDVCPVhSK6YtAm9IbbW-1YU1VeEij_A&oe=6AF09079"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kv-l6Jjx204Q7kNvwHMs_-c&_nc_oc=AdosKQxPOOBJlUy_YAC5VPp4OfPWuaRFLQtzL4CEXUQFjcfgeTaX19r4p_yYuy_dLvI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQToSaIaOTjvyM72oCMt_6-sTNoBNyTUdqcWDapkH2QcA&oe=6AF0A013"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LEXVbPxZL8QQ7kNvwH1OzB1&_nc_oc=Adpx8X3urKrLI7Kz_66iptq1AcsjzZHss_u2tCrnPfYz_ztaT-63wTuEvt7AB9bGg2c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRirvFF7_KX-yfn_v0uAz_C8gtbjjlGJtYK4Y0S94WwZA&oe=6AF0ABBB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q2bumBpMMiMQ7kNvwHXOUhF&_nc_oc=Adp3bJ1KBpsWMAlgi9Om81Jox831-z6eOxqDA4AqP9RVzKt20xLsp1ajTSPm6Puwpd8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRz9F32d1kSPNl1kUtxxkZS_-VTy2gUBk2Gt8f3cJKs6g&oe=6AF0AD0A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-NnFlscgatwQ7kNvwFh4tGn&_nc_oc=Adrr1Kyet1iWTHJ25tqj8iqmOihANx5BwQp73aRazboTbTWcbkmQ84Uu-A6FTSo5mX4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSvHKEHkmswYtiPNbSQxo-DmtTWGX5zLCvYTkGw9w9ofg&oe=6AF0963E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se